sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Web
  participant B as Backend Flight Sync
  participant M as EMQX
  participant E as ESP32 Wokwi
  W->>B: START
  B->>B: Validate flight and device
  B->>M: Mode command with commandId and bootId
  M->>E: Command
  E->>M: ACK or NACK
  M->>B: ACK or NACK
  E->>M: Telemetry v2
  M->>B: Telemetry confirms mode
  B->>B: Advance simulation only if synchronized
  W->>B: Read flight snapshot
  B-->>W: Current flight state
  Note over B,E: Fault or timeout: freeze simulation and safe-stop proxy
